{
    "title": "Easy hairstyles step by step",
    "description": "Do you need easy and quick hairstyles for school or work? Do you look for holiday, evening or wedding hairstyles? Perhaps do you want to experiment with style and try something new?\r\n\r\nWith our application you will find cool ideas for any occasion. Download it, follow the steps and shine right now! \ud83c\udf1f\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf80 Easy hairstyles step by step - is a large collection of video tutorials. Here you will find ideas according to every taste, to various styles and images. Everyone will find something interesting and useful.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Easy hairstyles step by step - is the best choice of every girl: \ud83d\udc8e\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49 For every day: simple basic ideas that are easy to do by yourself before school or work. And it won't take you a lot of time.\r\n\ud83d\udc49 For school: cute and quick ideas that will make a change in your school look, create a personal style and look great with your everyday outfit.\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Korean: Korean style is trending and continues to grow in popularity. Inspired by Korean pop divas, many want to try their ideas. The emphasis is on the smoothness and well-groomed hair. Most often, these are romantic images with a bang, with a crab, a voluminous elastic band or a satin ribbon.\r\n\ud83d\udc49 For holidays: A special collection of ideas with the addition of bright accent strands. Here you will learn how to create beautiful waves without using irons and curling irons.\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Anime: cartoonish is a hallmark of this style. Hair of bright colors, ears, ponytails, voluminous buns - everything, like on-screen heroes!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc9d Easy hairstyles step by step - is hairstyles for girls, ladies and women of all ages: both hairstyles for kids and for women are collected here.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc70\u200d\u2640\ufe0f If you have a solemn event and you need ideas for prom or wedding, then you will definitely find what you need here. You can easily repeat, thanks to the detailed tutorials. On this important day, you will look perfect!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd17 Everyone will be able to choose the perfect hairstyles for long hair, and they are all very simple:\r\n* Tails: ponytail, voluminous tail, low tail.\r\n* Braids: You will learn how to braid and get acquainted with a huge variety: French braid, Russian braid, waterfall braid, fishtail.\r\n* Buns: lazy sloppy bun, braid at the back of the head, bun of curls, rose, with a scarf.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Application Easy hairstyles step by step is simple to use: \ud83c\udf1f\r\n- All hairstyles for girls are conveniently categorized;\r\n- Each hairstyle is accompanied by detailed tutorials that are easy to repeat;\r\n- It is possible to add to favorites;\r\n- The app works without the Internet, offline.\r\n\r\nThe app is absolutely free and there is no paid content in it. \r\n\r\nThank you that you chose our app!\r\nWe look forward to your comments and suggestions! \ud83c\udf38",
