ed tutorials. On this important day, you will look perfect!<br><br>\ud83e\udd17 Everyone will be able to choose the perfect hairstyles for long hair, and they are all very simple:<br>* Tails: ponytail, voluminous tail, low tail.<br>* Braids: You will learn how to braid and get acquainted with a huge variety: French braid, Russian braid, waterfall braid, fishtail.<br>* Buns: lazy sloppy bun, braid at the back of the head, bun of curls, rose, with a scarf.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Application Easy hairstyles step by step is simple to use: \ud83c\udf1f<br>- All hairstyles for girls are conveniently categorized;<br>- Each hairstyle is accompanied by detailed tutorials that are easy to repeat;<br>- It is possible to add to favorites;<br>- The app works without the Internet, offline.<br><br>The app is absolutely free and there is no paid content in it. <br><br>Thank you that you chose our app!<br>We look forward to your comments and suggestions! \ud83c\udf38",
